          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We do our best to be as sustainable as possible. But what does that look like in the bike industry?</p><ul><li>Recycled carbon fiber programs from our older models</li><li>Consolidated shipping to reduce carbon emissions</li><li>Recyclable or reusable packaging</li><li>Support local biking organizations to promote cycling as a reliable, low-emission mode of transportation</li></ul>",
